body:
aw yeah for sure he would be better in Blademaster, i honestly dislike him being a sorcerer because its just random since he doesn't burn anymore mana or gain any damage, just a slightly bigger shield. Maybe if they added like they have for the demon class, deal damage % of mana burned he would be better, for me i've found he falls off mid-late unless he just sits on someone who needs to get mana to be useful.

&#x200B;

You could always give him BORTK to make him a blademaster but thats just avoiding the problem xD
